{"message":"The best fit for a roughly $600 paycheck is the **Green Fee-Free Account**: you would receive **$20** and your roommate would receive **$35**, for a combined **$55**. She must deposit at least **$300 in new money within 60 days** of opening, and keep it in the account for at least 30 additional days after the qualifying period. The referral cannot be combined with another sign-up promotion.

I confirmed that you’re eligible based on your existing referral activity and checking relationship. However, you currently have two referrals dated November 4 and November 10, so be aware of Rho-Bank’s limit of two referral bonuses in any rolling nine-day period; a new referral could be affected if bonuses qualify within the same window.

Other personal options requiring only $600 are less generous: Light Blue totals $50 ($30 + $20). Evergreen totals $60 but requires a $750 deposit, while Dark Green and Gold Years require $1,000. Your roommate must also be a new Rho-Bank customer, not registered at the same address as you, and generally at least 18."}
